  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT PARTLY STALE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096: all four defects reproduce (fixture + `hypergumbo run`). Raw edges are as filed; in the survey each hand-built src becomes one per-language node (`d:<unknown>:0-0:file:external_symbol`, likewise fish/bitbake; `hack:<unknown>:0-0:a.hack:external_symbol`) while the real `:1-1:file:file` node has no such edge. Lines now: fish.py:263/308, hack.py:452-453, d_lang.py:919, bitbake.py:229/264, make_file_id base.py:640. Sweep done by grep and fixture: same shape in starlark.py:578/615, ada.py:469, nim.py:1316, luau.py:422, gdscript.py:339 (dst); apex.py:807 has the string, not exercised. Bitbake dsts `bitbake:package:<pkg>` fold to one node: 3 depends_on edges become 1. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-misus.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # 2b04
- op: update  # fb93
